@ws1_host = http://localhost:3001
@ct = application/json

### GET /measurements — получить все измерения
GET {{ws1_host}}/measurements
Content-Type: {{ct}}

### POST /measurements — создать измерение
POST {{ws1_host}}/measurements
Content-Type: {{ct}}

{
  "channel": "CH-001",
  "value": 12.34
}

### PUT /measurements — апсерт (репликация из центра)
PUT {{ws1_host}}/measurements
Content-Type: {{ct}}

{
  "data": [
    { "id": 1, "channel": "CH-001", "value": 55.5 },
    { "id": 2, "channel": "CH-002", "value": 66.6 }
  ]
}

### POST /sync-time — синхронизация времени
POST {{ws1_host}}/sync-time
Content-Type: {{ct}}

{
  "centralTime": "{{$datetime rfc1123}}"
}

### NEGATIVE: /sync-time — без centralTime
POST {{ws1_host}}/sync-time
Content-Type: {{ct}}

{}